{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33802","headline":"太湖诗 包山祠 · 皮日休","name":"太湖诗 包山祠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白云最深处，像设盈岩堂。\n村祭足茗粣，水奠多桃桨。\n䇹䉦突古砌，薜荔绷颓墙。\n炉灰寂不然，风送杉桂香。\n积雨晦州里，流波漂稻粱。\n恭惟大司谏，悯此如发狂。\n命予传明祷，祗事实不遑。\n一奠若肸蠁，再祝如激扬。\n出庙未半日，隔云逢澹光。\n𡾼𡾼雨点少，渐收羽林\n忽然山家犬，起吠白日傍。\n公心与神志，相向如玄黄。\n我愿作一疏，奏之於穹苍。\n留神千万祀，永福吴封疆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33802.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33802","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}